        <title>2-Segal sets and pseudomonoids in the bicategory of spans</title>
            <categories>math.CT math.AT</categories>
            <comments>v2: Numerous changes, incorporating referee comments. Most notable changes are the addition of Section 6.1 and Example 6.6. To appear in Boletín de Matemáticas</comments>
