        <title>Derived equivalence classification of twisted and generalized multifold extensions of affine type</title>
            <categories>math.RT math.CT math.RA</categories>
            <comments>43 pages. Appendix A has been revised: the proof of Proposition A.2 now uses a covering theorem for group actions rather than the more general 2-categorical machinery. The main results are unchanged</comments>
            <msc-class>Primary 16E35, Secondary 16D50, 16G20, 16G70</msc-class>
